{"title":"2025 CEMC Hypatia Problems/Problem 1a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2025 CEMC Hypatia Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>To begin, tokens are distributed <i>unequally</i> between two people. Every minute following this, each person receives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more tokens.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Tokens are distributed between Abi and Brody with Abi receiving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> tokens and Brody receiving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> tokens. How many tokens does Abi have in total after <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> minutes?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since each person receives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more tokens per minute, Abi will get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/a/2aaa87f27a7cbbb8ba8272909fbe613a0bc09234.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 7 = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" /> more tokens after <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> minutes.\n</p><p>Abi started out with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> tokens, so Abi will have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/7/2a7b2397bd029e03356a191e872d9c7f2201d2b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30 + 14 = \\boxed{44}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"114\" height=\"25\" /> tokens in total.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018032247\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 43/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 243/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1576/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.299      1 2025_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%    6.299      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36310:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018032247 and revision id 281328. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}